      "description": "Currently building zero-to-one AI-powered products to help businesses create value through automation, personalization, and intelligent workflows.\n\nKey highlights:\nDesigned and deployed a high-scale backend service to route messaging campaigns through Meta’s ad personalization engine; MVP contributed 38% of org-wide message volume.\n\nDirected a multi-disciplinary team to consolidate and modernize offsite signal APIs across Meta's ad stack, reducing code duplication by 3× and improving platform reliability and adoption.\n\nImplemented a new full-funnel conversion objective, owning backend event pipelines, attribution systems, reporting infra, and Ads Manager UI; drove $500M+ in annual revenue.\n\nShipped a redesigned Events Manager interface used by 100K+ businesses to manage and debug offsite signal integrations, significantly improving usability and troubleshooting.\n\nPrototyped AI-powered internal tools in hackathons: 1) A real-time meeting translation assistant using LLMs and transcription models. 2) developer digest bot to accelerate onboarding and internal comms.",
